BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.07 Tm (operating_framework) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.85 Tm (The six modules form one copy-pasteable Python reference program: concatenate their code cells in order) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 442.62 Tm (and run them with Python 3.9 or later. They use only SQLite and the standard library, create a local) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 427.40 Tm (recovery.sqlite3 file, and expose functions rather than initiating treasury requests. Execute them first against) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 412.17 Tm (a disposable database; this chapter supplies reference source, not a report of executed tests. The design) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.95 Tm (assumes one trusted application service owns database writes, local storage implements SQLite locking) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.72 Tm (correctly, and each worker opens its own connection. Do not place the live database on an ordinary network) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 366.50 Tm (filesystem. BEGIN IMMEDIATE serializes writers before they inspect state; unique property keys, unique) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 351.27 Tm (receipt references, and immutable accounting rows provide additional barriers. A busy timeout produces an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 336.05 Tm (explicit failure rather than permission to skip locking. Each operation stores a canonical request fingerprint) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.82 Tm (and response inside the same transaction as its changes. Repeating the same operation returns its) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 305.60 Tm (recorded result; reusing its key with different input fails. These mechanisms remove check-then-write races) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 290.37 Tm (within this local ledger under the stated deployment boundaries.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 275.15 Tm (Keep the state machine narrower than the marketing funnel. INTAKE becomes VERIFIED only after identity,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.92 Tm (authority, current jurisdiction rules, and a permitted agreement have been checked outside the scoring) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 244.70 Tm (function. FILED requires an official submission reference, APPROVED requires agency evidence, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 229.47 Tm (OWNER_PAID requires evidence that the owner actually received the property. The reference stores that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 214.25 Tm (evidence's opaque identifier and writes a permanent transition record. ESCROW_REVIEW is an exception) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 199.02 Tm (state, not an escrow account: the business does not receive, pool, or redistribute client principal. Its only exit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 183.80 Tm (returns to VERIFIED after documented resolution, requiring later filing stages to be established again. If a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 168.57 Tm (matter genuinely requires custody or escrow, route it to a separately authorized provider and keep it out of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 153.35 Tm (this payment workflow. The scoring script ranks expected effort using nonnegative integer cents and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 138.12 Tm (evidence indicators; it cannot establish ownership or waive a statutory restriction. Reject oversized integers,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 122.90 Tm (empty identifiers, and contradictory duplicate property records before they enter the working queue. A low) Tj ET
